      "blocks": [
        {
          "title": "if i were a coach selling in my *DMs*, here's how i'd handle my *inbox*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "heading": "*boring as h\\*ll*"
        },
        {
          "text": "but it's where your money is.\n\nyour Reel worked. the comments came in. now the real job starts in your DMs, usually at 11:47 pm, from the couch.\n\nhere's what i see in almost every coach's inbox:"
        },
        {
          "lead": "the same 3 questions, answered too late, by someone who's exhausted."
        },
        {
          "spacer": 6
        },
        {
          "chart": "dots",
          "rows": [
            {
              "label": "people who commented",
              "total": 34,
              "filled": 0,
              "caption": "they wanted the guide"
            },
            {
              "label": "people who asked a real question",
              "total": 34,
              "filled": 9,
              "caption": "these are the ones who were ready to talk"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "heading": "*first thing*"
        },
        {
          "lead": "i'd stop sending the price and then going quiet."
        },
        {
          "text": "someone writes \"how much is it?\". you send the price. then nothing happens for two whole days.\n\nthat's a long time to stare at \"seen\".\n\nso i'd send the price **and one question** in the same message."
        },
        {
