        {
          "heading": "*quick pause*"
        },
        {
          "text": "you're probably wondering who's writing this.\n\nhi, i built ManySetter, an AI setter for Manychat. your flow still sends the first message. when the lead replies, my setter takes over. it learns your offer, asks one question at a time, and hands the big conversations back to you."
